    "collapsible_content_BDtqAW": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_hqB3B8": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What are the features of your prescription scuba masks?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Our masks are made from soft, hypoallergenic, food-grade silicone for maximum comfort. The tempered glass lenses are scratch-resistant and provide clear vision underwater. Interchangeable lenses allow you to upgrade as your prescription changes.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_VzDAME": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I choose the right prescription for my scuba mask?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>We offer custom prescription lenses for myopia and farsightedness. Use our underwater lens calculator tool to determine the correct sphere strength based on your prescription.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_JMpnxV": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I get a mask with different prescriptions for each eye?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, on selected models our masks allow for different sphere strengths in each eye to ensure optimal vision underwater.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_9rWnhX": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are these masks suitable for all face shapes?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>We have a variety of masks to suit a variety of face shapes. Please check the details on the individualk products page. All our masks are designed with a flexible silicone skirt that adapts to various face shapes, providing a secure and comfortable fit for everyone.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_7AGJfK": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How should I care for and maintain my prescription scuba mask?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Rinse your mask with fresh water after each use, avoid using abrasive cleaners, and store it in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight. Regular care will extend the life of your mask.</p><p></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_x4AQ8Q": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is the return policy if the mask doesn’t fit or I’m not satisfied?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>We offer a 30-day return policy from date of delivery for unworn and unused items in their original packaging.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_xWBxyj": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How long does shipping take, im in florida?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Please allow 5-14 days for delivery, we average around 7 days delivery time but this is dependant on time of the year and USPS. We will do our best to get it to you as quickly as possible.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_739Gy8": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What makes buying from Oceans Optics unique?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Beyond high-quality masks, our Free digital e-guide provides valuable diving tips and is updated regularly. </p><p>We are run by divers who have real industry experience ready to assist you. </p><p>Additionally, our lenses are interchangeable, allowing you to update them as your prescription changes. Just buy 1 mask for life.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
